  m_text: " \"For as long as I can remember, my embers sought warmth from another great flame.\r\nYet not a soul among the royalty could compare for their shallow desires \nare incinerated by my need to satiate a great wildfire within me.\r\nHowever a beast of your nature and tenacity is sure to carry an ambitious \ninferno of a heart that too can withstand another.\""
