  m_OnCullStateChanged:
    m_PersistentCalls:
      m_Calls: []
  m_text: ' "As bizarre as it feels, there was a certain bond we formed during our chase.

    The desire of one flame causing the next to lash out with their own fire.

    All to say, I shall accept your searing love and provide the same to you Princess."'
